---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import MaterialCards from '../components/MaterialCards.astro';
import { publishedMaterials } from '../data/materials';
const papers = (await publishedMaterials()).filter(e => e.data.kind === 'paper');
---
<Shell active="library/" title="论文精读"><header class="page-intro shell-width" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">READ THE METHOD, QUESTION THE EVIDENCE</span><h1>从代表论文理解技术路线</h1><p>每篇材料重建方法流程、解读关键图表，并保留实验条件、局限与核验状态。来源核验与独立复现分别记录。</p></header><div class="shell-width collection-body"><section class="collection-section"><div class="collection-heading"><h2>缓存与计算复用</h2><span>内存管理 → 前缀复用 → 缓存融合</span></div><MaterialCards entries={papers.filter(e => e.data.topics.includes('cache'))} /></section><section class="collection-section"><div class="collection-heading"><h2>Agent 预算与成本决策</h2><span>预算感知 → 探索与停止 → 策略学习</span></div><MaterialCards entries={papers.filter(e => e.data.topics.includes('budget'))} /></section><div class="reading-callout"><a href="/reports/">比较方法与适用条件</a><a href="/systems/">查看系统实现与业务案例</a></div></div></Shell>
